## Coordination protocol (shared board)
- The board is [`{{.BoardRel}}`]({{.BoardRel}}). Keep **Current Focus** current.
- Dispatch work as `@<role>: <request>` — every request MUST carry a Definition of Done (acceptance checks + the proof each must produce).
- When a role appends proof, verify it against the DoD, then write `[DONE <date>]` on the request line (only you do this). No proof, or a failing check → leave it open with a note.
- Keep the team unblocked: triage `RESOURCE-REQUESTS.md`, sequence the work, and keep **Next Actions** honest.
- The team hook pokes this pane when a fresh `@lead:` request lands, and re-lists pending ones on boot — re-read the board when nudged.

